Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for all your help today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the trouble. No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That crazy ride on the buggy\Nmore than made up for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.27,0:03:20.74,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1194,189)\fad(155,0)\blur1.2\fscx21\fscy21\c&HF3F2EB&}The Third Bullet of Bullets Preliminary Entry > Entrant Information Input
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.27,0:03:20.74,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1188,222)\fad(155,0)\blur1.2\fscx28\fscy28\frz-0.4\c&HF3F2EB&}Tournament Entry Complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, which block did you\Nend up with for the prelims?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, F, I guess.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.74,0:03:24.49,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1231.5,262.5)\blur1.2\fscx189\fscy189\frz356.1\c&HDFDAE2&\fax-0.1}Y{*\fax-0.09}o{*\fax-0.09}u{*\fax-0.08}r {*\fax-0.07}N{*\fax-0.06}u{*\fax-0.06}m{*\fax-0.05}b{*\fax-0.05}e{\fax-0.04}r
