Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,F-37.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.05,0:03:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an F-2, number 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of a cool coincidence, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did we meet, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.49,0:03:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to meet\Nup again until the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a player makes it to the\Nfinal bracket in the prelims,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.00,0:03:55.98,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(489,190.5)\blur1.2\fscx21\fscy21\frz-0.4\c&HF3F2EB&}The Third Bullet of Bullets Preliminary Entry > Entrant Information Input
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.00,0:03:55.98,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(484.5,222)\blur1.2\fscx28\fscy28\frz-0.4\c&HF3F2EB&}Tournament Entry Complete.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.00,0:03:55.98,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1194,189)\blur1.2\fscx21\fscy21\c&HF3F2EB&}The Third Bullet of Bullets Preliminary Entry > Entrant Information Input
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.00,0:03:55.98,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1188,222)\blur1.2\fscx28\fscy28\frz-0.4\c&HF3F2EB&}Tournament Entry Complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it won't matter if they lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll automatically\Nadvance to the battle royale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means we both have a shot at\Nadvancing to the battle royale,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as we make it\Nto the last bracket. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.71,0:03:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we do meet in the final bracket of\Nthe prelims, I'll be playing to win. Oh.
