Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The official site was English only.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Zaskar, the company that developed\Nand runs the game, is American.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They probably have some Japanese\Nstaff to run Japan's server.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but GDO operates in a legal\Ngray zone here and in the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.53,0:04:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of its cash\Nconversion system, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't find anything on the company's\Nhomepage except the most basic information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for managing your\Ncharacter or accessing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your e-money account to\Nconvert what you earn,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any and all game-related procedures\Nhave to be done in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shady but amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The game's practically\Nindependent of the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why the\Nperson I am in here and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the real me feel like\Ntwo different people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't know why I went there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should start heading\Nover to the prelim area now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure. That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the waiting room first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.19,0:05:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to need some privacy\Nto change into your new combat suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
