Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.23,0:06:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, what a bunch of dumbasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those tough-looking guys outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a half-hour before the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.49,0:06:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're out there showing\Noff their main weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they're asking you to\Ncome up with a countermeasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't equip your photon sword in 5-7\Nuntil just before your match starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get changed already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.43,0:06:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't change now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, I mean, I, I'm sorry. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't introduced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's an interesting\Nname, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Male!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, you, you're a, you're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a guy with that avatar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You? Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop following me, but I'm not sure\Nwhat I'm supposed to do after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.69,0:07:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop following me, okay, but\NI don't know anyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop following me, but what I
