Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.89,0:08:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it, but\Njust the bare minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.19,0:08:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, you and me are enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, just so we're clear,\Nthis doesn't mean I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that clock up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it hits zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone here will be automatically\Ntransferred to a battlefield,
