Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The field's a square.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each side's a kilometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.61,0:09:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather, terrain, and time\Nare all randomly generated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your opponent's placed\N500 meters away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever wins the match\Ngets transferred back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.23,0:09:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The loser's transferred\Nto the first-floor hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you don't get penalized\Nfor losing a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are 64 people in Block F,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.53,0:09:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so five wins will take\Nyou to the final and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll be eligible for the Battle Royale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I got the gist of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better reach the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because even after everything\NI taught you today,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's one thing left for you to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The taste of the bullet that beats you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you'll make it to the finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.15,0:10:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll retire if I get\Nknocked out of the prelims.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.69,0:10:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll kill all the strong ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since this is the last\Ntime we'll be chatting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like this you should\Nknow my name there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of the person who's\Ngonna beat you seen on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kirito. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.61,0:10:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About time you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't find you anywhere, and I was\Nworried you weren't going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Spiegel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally lost track of time,\Nthanks to an unexpected chore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.49,0:10:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you weren't competing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:10:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, even though I know\Nhow much it bugs you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd sort of cheer\Nyou on from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already picked out a spot in front\Nof the jumbo screen and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that unexpected\Nchore you were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just giving this\Nperson a sort of orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, it's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, are you a friend of Sinon's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to break it to you, but she's a dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my name's Kirito. I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then does that mean he's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sinon, thanks for\Nshowing me a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a great first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.01,0:11:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a good time\Nand it was not a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a mistake, so forget my\Nname and forget we ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heartless, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we spent the whole day\Ntogether picking out all my gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but only cuz you li -
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:11:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patience players.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready\Nbecause the third bullet of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bullets preliminary\Ntournament is about to begin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the countdown clock reaches zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All competing players\Nwill be automatically
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transported to their respective\Nfirst-round field maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better make it to the finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I'm looking forward\Nto blowing your head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept the invitation, but\Ndon't keep me waiting too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I went a little too far there.
