Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll kill all the strong ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.91,0:13:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could she be Death Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw two sides of her, but\Nwhich is the real Sinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't find out standing\Nhere, thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.03,0:13:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we cross swords, I mean, traded\Nshots, I'm sure I'll find the answer.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.82,0:13:43.73,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(597,258)\blur1.8\fscx287\fscy287\frz348.3\c&H464142&\b1\fax0.03}Prep Time      :     {\c&H3120DF&}01 {\c&H464142&}Second Left
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.82,0:13:43.73,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(802.5,888)\blur1.8\fscx287\fscy287\frz348.3\c&H464142&\b1\fax0.03}Field     :     Lost Ancient Temple
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't dodge all those bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll never\Nget closer to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I could use my sword to\Ndeflect the bullets, I could get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're flying too damn fast, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can predict\Nthe trajectory of each bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullet lines tell me exactly\Nwhat path the bullets are traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little further!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.59,0:18:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I have to\Ndo this four more times?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.51,0:18:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Sinon is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the real deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.73,0:19:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw your match.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.81,0:19:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took him out with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.81,0:19:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not against the rules, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the real deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been face to face like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.15,0:20:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do I know him from?
