Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.97,0:22:31.60,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k33}Na{\k45}n{\k22}do {\k38}mo {\k51}se {\k42}wo {\k23}mu{\k21}ke{\k47}te{\k41}ta
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.60,0:22:38.98,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}While hiding the scars I can never show anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.60,0:22:38.98,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k27}Da{\k44}re {\k22}ni {\k48}mo {\k42}mi{\k48}se{\k22}ra{\k19}re {\k47}nai {\k16}ki{\k30}zu {\k44}wo {\k21}ka{\k17}ku{\k51}shi{\k21}ta {\k26}ma{\k37}ma {\k49}zu{\k107}tto
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.98,0:22:46.11,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I will embrace all this pain that has started flooding through me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.98,0:22:46.11,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k23}A{\k30}fu{\k22}re {\k16}da{\k24}shi{\k24}ta {\k24}ko{\k22}no {\k23}i{\k24}ta{\k23}mi {\k99}wa {\k32}su{\k19}be{\k18}te {\k30}hi{\k23}to{\k21}ri {\k24}de {\k20}da{\k16}ki {\k30}shi{\k26}me{\k100}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.07,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I don't need warmth at all
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.07,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k32}It{\k22}su{\k21}ka {\k24}ki{\k23}e{\k21}ru {\k22}nu{\k23}ku{\k26}mo{\k20}ri {\k22}na{\k40}ra
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.07,0:22:53.70,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If it will vanish one day
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.07,0:22:53.70,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k24}Hi{\k21}to{\k26}tsu {\k46}mo {\k24}i{\k41}ra{\k44}nai {\k237}yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.70,0:23:01.63,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wished so hard to become stronger than ever
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.70,0:23:01.63,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k98}Mo{\k46}tto {\k44}tsu{\k23}yo{\k88}ku {\k29}sou {\k40}tsu{\k22}yo{\k91}ku {\k21}na{\k44}ri{\k25}ta{\k45}i {\k44}to {\k45}ne{\k44}ga{\k44}tta
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.63,0:23:08.05,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Like a lonely star racing across the darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.63,0:23:08.05,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k23}Ku{\k21}ra{\k21}ya{\k48}mi {\k22}wo {\k43}ka{\k48}ke{\k131}ru {\k26}ko{\k20}do{\k23}ku {\k43}na {\k21}ho{\k48}shi {\k20}no {\k25}you {\k59}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sunk so deep inside my heart, I'm so weak and fragile
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k53}Ko{\k45}ko{\k44}ro {\k45}fu{\k22}ka{\k86}ku {\k30}shi{\k43}zu{\k22}me{\k89}ta {\k21}yo{\k44}wa{\k24}ku{\k44}te {\k46}mo{\k44}roi {\k25}ji{\k49}bun
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.81,0:23:22.90,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I can't put it into words, or even speak out
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.81,0:23:22.90,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k38}Ko{\k26}to{\k19}ba {\k46}ni {\k20}de{\k47}ki{\k32}na{\k11}ku{\k134}te {\k25}ko{\k25}e {\k18}ni {\k46}mo {\k21}na{\k46}ra{\k24}na{\k16}ku{\k115}te
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.90,0:23:27.94,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm just waiting for the light
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.90,0:23:27.94,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k68}Ki{\k22}tto {\k34}da{\k31}re {\k26}ni {\k30}mo {\k35}mi{\k23}tsu{\k39}ka{\k29}ra {\k23}na{\k34}i {\k32}yo{\k24}u {\k54}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.94,0:23:33.66,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)}Trying not to be found by anyone
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.94,0:23:33.66,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\k34}Ta{\k64}da {\k17}hik{\k56}ari {\k26}wo {\k42}ma{\k20}tte{\k313}ru
